# The Hall of Fame and the keys: an arrow key and Tab are ignored (the window stays); Return closes it, a letter closes it,
# a digit closes it, and so does Escape. Opened with the script host's "open" step.
25 load
42 state fame 0x9a3840 0x1324
42 state work 0x74e50c 0x3c
42 state sel 0x758410 4
42 state group 0x7534e8 0x10
42 state rects 0x758f24 0x60
42 state btn0 0x753fb4 4
42 state btn1 0x754b00 4
42 state btn2 0x75564c 4
42 state btn3 0x756198 4
42 state btn4 0x756ce4 4
42 state btn5 0x757830 4
44 open hall_of_fame
50 snap open
52 key Down
56 snap key-down
58 key Tab
62 snap key-tab
64 key Return
68 snap closed-return
70 open hall_of_fame
76 key a
80 snap closed-letter
82 open hall_of_fame
88 key 5
92 snap closed-digit
94 open hall_of_fame
100 key Escape
104 snap closed-escape
108 close
